# Instagram Video Downloads

When asked to download an Instagram reel, post, or video:

1. Ensure the directory exists: `~/Downloads/10pwarmups`
2. Download with yt-dlp:

```bash
mkdir -p ~/Downloads/10pwarmups
yt-dlp -o "~/Downloads/10pwarmups/%(title)s [%(id)s].%(ext)s" "<instagram-url>"
```

- Use the full Instagram URL the user provides (reel, post, or story).
- Do not rename or move files unless the user asks.
- Report the final file path after download completes.
